51:36.759 --> 51:37.844
Awak berjudi?

51:40.179 --> 51:41.180
Apa?

51:41.973 --> 51:43.099
Kenapa?

51:44.100 --> 51:46.102
Hei, Nam-il! Keluarlah!

51:46.519 --> 51:48.271
Sudahlah, jangan campur urusan saya.

51:48.354 --> 51:50.273
Hei, Nam-il, awak mahu ke mana?
Mari berbual.

51:50.356 --> 51:52.525
Hei, aduh, lutut saya. Nam-il!

51:52.984 --> 51:54.027
Awak mahu ke mana?

51:54.611 --> 51:56.195
Awak mahu ke mana?

51:57.155 --> 51:58.406
Pakailah seluar!

52:05.163 --> 52:06.372
